        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: James Rooney\n- Organizations: Australia national soccer team, Football Federation Australia, Asian Football Confederation, ASEAN Football Federation, Oceania Football Confederation\n- Events: 1974 FIFA World Cup\n- Places: Dundee, Scotland, West Germany\n- Topics: association football\n\nFacts:\n- James Rooney was born on 10 December 1945 in Dundee, Scotland.\n- James Rooney is a former association football player.\n- James Rooney was a member of the Australian squad at the 1974 FIFA World Cup in West Germany.\n- The Australia national soccer team is officially nicknamed the Socceroos.\n- Football Federation Australia controls the Australia national soccer team.\n- Football Federation Australia left the Oceania Football Confederation in 2006.\n- Football Federation Australia is currently a member of the Asian Football Confederation and the ASEAN Football Federation.",
